      "translation": {"english_text": "Kumaran, a young man imbued with ideas of renaissance.", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": ["`மறுமலர்ச்சி` is kept as `renaissance` rather than narrowed to a later ideological label not printed here."]}
    },
    {
      "id": "naam-en-s001-u002",
